Z||000001||rogergarrison||10-05-2001||08:33 AM||||You can buy a small plastic bottle of Fuel Injector Cleaner and just add it to a tank of gas every so often.I do every couple of months. Also can buy a spray can of cleaner to spray directly into intake where the large hose from air cleaner goes.<P>About the idle, does you 'check engine' lite come on?<P>------------------<BR>         <IMG SRC="http://albums.photopoint.com/j/View?u=1234884&a=11878523&p=52990885"> ||||reg||1
